-- Add creature_text rows present in the upstream LegionCore 2024-10-23 world dump
-- (The-Legion-Preservation-Project/LegionCore-7.3.5) but missing from our world DB.
-- Column names/order match CreatureTextMgr::LoadCreatureTexts (WORLD_SEL_CREATURE_TEXT),
-- which does not read MinTimer/MaxTimer/SpellID (source-only columns, dropped).
-- Source has no TextRange column; defaulted to 0, matching 98% of our existing rows.
-- Source primary key includes Text (2961 duplicate (Entry,GroupID,ID) groups existed);
-- one representative row per (Entry,GroupID,ID) was kept to match our schema's PK.
