(28939,3,0,'I\'m through being courteous with your kind, human! What is the "Crimson Dawn?"',12,0,100,0,0,0,29135,0,''),
(28939,4,0,'Is your life worth so little? Just tell me what I need to know about "Crimson Dawn" and I\'ll end your suffering quickly.',12,0,100,0,0,0,29139,0,''),
(28939,5,0,'I can keep this up for a very long time, Scarlet dog! Tell me about the "Crimson Dawn!"',12,0,100,0,0,0,29137,0,''),
(28939,7,0,'"Crimson Dawn!" What is it! Speak!',12,0,100,0,0,0,29136,0,''),
(28939,8,0,'You\'ll be hanging in the gallows shortly, Scourge fiend!',12,0,100,0,0,0,29160,0,''),
(28939,9,0,'You\'ll have to kill me, monster! I will tell you NOTHING!',12,0,100,0,0,0,29142,0,''),
(28939,10,0,'You hit like a girl. Honestly. Is that the best you can do?',12,0,100,0,0,0,29162,0,''),
(28939,11,0,'ARGH! You burned my last good tabard!',12,0,100,0,0,0,29143,0,''),
(28939,12,0,'Argh... The pain... The pain is almost as unbearable as the lashings I received in grammar school when I was but a child.',12,0,100,0,0,0,29143,0,''),
(28939,13,0,'I used to work for Grand Inquisitor Isillien! Your idea of pain is a normal mid-afternoon for me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,29161,0,''),
(28939,14,0,'I\'ll tell you everything! STOP! PLEASE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,29149,0,''),
(28939,15,0,'We... We have only been told that the "Crimson Dawn" is an awakening. You see, the Light speaks to the High General. It is the Light...',12,0,100,0,0,0,29150,0,''),
(28939,16,0,'The Light that guides us. The movement was set in motion before you came... We... We do as we are told. It is what must be done.',12,0,100,0,0,0,29151,0,''),
(28939,17,0,'I know very little else... The High General chooses who may go and who must stay behind. There\'s nothing else... You must believe me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,29152,0,''),
(28939,18,0,'LIES! The pain you are about to endure will be talked about for years to come!',12,0,100,0,0,0,29163,0,''),
(28939,19,0,'NO! PLEASE! There is one more thing that I forgot to mention... A courier comes soon... From Hearthglen. It...',12,0,100,0,0,0,29153,0,''),
