(29204,0,0,'%s flee',16,0,100,0,0,0,29758,0,'Orbaz'),
(29227,0,0,'My son! My dear, beautiful boy!',12,0,100,0,0,14493,29762,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),
(29227,1,0,'Nothing could have kept me away from here, Darion. Not from my home and family.',12,0,100,1,0,14494,29773,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),
(29227,2,0,'Darion Mograine, you are barely of age to hold a sword, let alone battle the undead hordes of Lordaeron! I couldn\'t bear losing you. Even the thought...',12,0,100,1,0,14495,29775,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),
(29227,3,0,'My son, there will come a day when you will command the Ashbringer and, with it, mete justice across this land. I have no doubt that when that day finally comes, you will bring pride to our people and that Lordaeron will be a better place because of you. But, my son, that day is not today.',12,0,100,1,0,14496,29777,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),
(29227,4,0,'Do not forget...',12,0,100,6,0,14497,29778,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),
(29227,5,0,'%s arrives.',16,0,100,0,0,0,1415,0,'Highlord Alexandros Mograine'),
(29227,6,0,'%s disappears, and the Lich King appears.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,'Alexandros'),
(29228,0,0,'Father, you have returned!',12,0,100,0,0,14703,29769,0,'Darion Mograine'),
(29228,1,0,'You have been gone a long time, father. I thought...',12,0,100,0,0,14704,29770,0,'Darion Mograine'),
(29228,2,0,'Father, I wish to join you in the war against the undead. I want to fight! I can sit idle no longer!',12,0,100,6,0,14705,29774,0,'Darion Mograine'),
(29228,3,0,'If I die, father, I would rather it be on my feet, standing in defiance against the undead legions! If I die, father, I die with you!',12,0,100,6,0,14706,29776,0,'Darion Mograine'),
