(49226,0,0,'Welcome to my personal sanctum, heroes! I hope you find the accommodations to your liking. Herein you will find many of my failed experiments and ultimately my greatest triumph!',14,0,0,0,0,20090,49415,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event22'),
(49226,1,0,'Mortals that fancy themselves HEROES have entered the Broken Hall! Oh, I do hope this \'raid\' will amuse me more than the last!',14,0,0,0,0,23379,49053,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ZoneIntro01'),
(49226,2,0,'I should\'ve known better than to rely on something so stupidly named... to entertain me for long.',14,0,0,0,0,23373,49059,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronDead01'),
(49226,3,0,'Hmm, the Omnotron Defense System. Centuries ago, these constructs were considered the dwarves greatest tactical achievements. With so many counters to each construct\'s attacks, I\'ll have to rectify these designs for them to provide me ANY entertainment!',14,0,0,0,0,23374,49054,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronIntro01'),
(49226,4,0,'You would like to move away from that, wouldn\'t you? Too bad.',14,0,0,0,0,23375,49055,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronSpell01'),
(49226,5,0,'Stupid dwarves and your fascination with runes. Why would you create something that would help your enemy?',14,0,0,0,0,23376,49056,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronSpell02'),
(49226,6,0,'Lightning Conductor works much better in a crowd, yes?',14,0,0,0,0,23377,49057,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronSpell03'),
(49226,7,0,'Were you planing on using Toxitron\'s chemicals to damage the other constructs? Clever plan. Let me ruin that for you.',14,0,0,0,0,23378,49058,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_OmnitronSpell04'),
(49226,8,0,'That malfunctioning piece of junk was murder on the repair bills.',14,0,0,0,0,20086,49411,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event18'),
(49226,9,0,'I found this fascinating speciman in the lava underneath this very room. Magmaw should provide an adequate challenge for your pathetic little band!',14,0,0,0,0,23367,49060,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MagmawIntro01'),
(49226,10,0,'Finally someone to deal with that unsightly pest! You have my thanks, "heroes."',14,0,0,0,0,20085,49410,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event17'),
(49226,11,0,'You won! How... disappointing. I could\'ve easily watched you all continue to stand in the fire.',14,0,0,0,0,23366,49062,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MagmawDead01'),
(49226,12,0,'INCONCEIVEABLE! You may actually defeat my lava worm! Perhaps I can help... TIP the scales.',14,0,0,0,0,23368,49782,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MagmawLowHealth'),
(49226,13,0,'On second thought, what fun is an adequate challenge?',14,0,0,0,0,23369,49061,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MagmawSummon01'),
(49226,14,0,'Maloriak, try not to lose to these mortals! Semi-competent help is SO hard to create.',14,0,0,0,0,23372,49068,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MaloriakIntro01'),
(49226,15,0,'Your mixtures are weak, Maloriak! They need a bit more... kick!',14,0,0,0,0,23370,49069,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Maloriak01'),
(49226,16,0,'Congratulations! Allow me to grant you a title befitting the amazing achievement you just performed! Henceforth, you shall be known as the Slayer of Incompetent, Stupid and Disappointing Minions!',14,0,0,0,0,23371,49070,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_MaloriakDead01'),
(49226,17,0,'We never did see eye to eye... Good riddance I say!',14,0,0,0,0,20089,49414,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event21'),
(49226,18,0,'You should\'ve been disposed of a long time ago.',14,0,0,0,0,23357,49077,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_AtramedesDead'),
(49226,19,0,'These shields are proving quite the nuisance!',14,0,0,0,0,23358,49076,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_AtramedesGong'),
(49226,20,0,'Atramedes, the heroes are RIGHT THERE!',14,0,0,0,0,23359,49075,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_AtramedesImp01'),
(49226,21,0,'Atramedes, are you going deaf as well as blind? Hurry up and kill them all!',14,0,0,0,0,23360,49074,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_AtramedesIntro'),
(49226,22,0,'Now that was really unnecessary.',14,0,0,0,0,23387,49412,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event19'),
(49226,23,0,'Impressive! You managed to destroy one of my most horrific creations - a task I\'d thought impossible until now.',14,0,0,0,0,20088,49413,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_Event20'),
(49226,24,0,'A shame to lose that experiment...',14,0,0,0,0,23361,49067,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ChimaronDead01'),
(49226,25,0,'Ah, Chimaeron! Truly a living testament to my scientific prowess. I reworked and twisted his form countless times over the years and the final result is truly something to behold.',14,0,0,0,0,23362,49063,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ChimaronIntro01'),
(49226,26,0,'Oh. You were expecting something else to happen just then, weren\'t you? Let\'s see how YOU adapt after a new set of adjustments, shall we?',14,0,0,0,0,23363,49064,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ChimaronSpell01'),
(49226,27,0,'Stop fighting yourself THIS INSTANT Chimaeron!',14,0,0,0,0,23364,49065,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ChimaronSpell02'),
(49226,28,0,'This fight has gone a bit stale. Allow me to spice things up!',14,0,0,0,0,23365,49066,0,'VO_BD_Nefarian_ChimaronSpell03'),
