(61442,0,0,'Clan Gurthan will show our King and the rest of you power-hungry imposters why we are the rightful ones at his side!',12,0,100,0,0,27932,61077,0,'aggro'),
(61442,1,0,'We will never surrender our right to rule the destiny of our people!',12,0,100,0,0,27933,61077,0,'defeated'),
(61442,2,0,'The glory of Gurthan!',12,0,100,0,0,27942,61077,0,'killing a player'),
(61442,3,0,'Who allowed these outsiders in our halls!? Only Clan Harthak or Clan Korgesh would stoop to such treachery!',12,0,100,0,0,27940,61077,0,'outro'),
(61442,4,0,'A well-scripted exchange, but we are not fooled! Your clans are clearly in league with one another! For the glory of our King, our empire, we will put you all down!',12,0,100,0,0,27941,61077,0,'outro2'),
(61442,5,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_shaman_earthquake.blp:20|tКуай Бесчеловечный пускает |cFFFF0000|Hspell:119922|h[ударную волну]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,65534,0,''),
(61444,0,0,'Our clan holds true to the ways set forth by the ancients. We deserve the king\'s favor above all others!',12,0,100,0,0,27950,61562,0,'intro1'),
(61444,1,0,'Clan Harthak will show all why they are the truest of Mogu!',12,0,100,0,0,27947,60934,0,'aggro'),
(61444,2,0,'Our clan is the true clan! No interloper can change that!',12,0,100,0,0,27948,60944,0,'defeated'),
(61444,3,0,'This is the might of Harthak!',12,0,100,0,0,27957,63315,0,'killing a player'),
(61444,4,0,'Only the dogs of clan Gurthan would point fingers at others for their own failures! Your clan is the most desperate! It must have been you!',12,0,100,0,0,27955,61072,0,'outro'),
(61444,5,0,'Silence, you motherless mu\'shan herders! I\'d blame your clan, but your skulls are too thick to figure out a child\'z puzzle box, let alone how to usurp power.',12,0,100,0,0,27956,61076,0,'outro02'),
(61445,0,0,'Clan Kargesh will demonstrate why only the strong deserve to stand at our King\'s side!',12,0,100,0,0,28246,60933,0,'Aggro'),
(61445,1,0,'Impossible! Our might is the greatest in all the empire!',12,0,100,0,0,28247,60945,0,'Defeated'),
(61445,2,0,'For Korgesh!',12,0,100,0,0,28256,63316,0,'Killing a player'),
(61445,3,0,'Clan Gurthan is right! Only the honorous Clan Harthak could bring in a lesser race to do their bidding! You must be traitors!',12,0,100,0,0,28254,61074,0,'outro'),
(61445,4,0,'Clan Korgesh will not suffer these insults! We will have your heads to offer to the King as proof of our might soon enough!',12,0,100,0,0,28255,61078,0,'outro2'),
(61454,3,0,'Сокруши захватчиков и сбрось их со стены!',12,0,100,0,0,0,61500,0,'Суна Беззвучный Удар to Player'),
