(64191,3,0,'До встречи, $n.',12,0,100,3,0,0,111948,0,'Призрачный пандарен-ремесленник to Player'),
(64202,1,0,'Уйди-ка ты с дороги, слышь?',12,0,100,1,0,0,64656,0,'Мастер проклятий из племени Гурубаши to Player'),
(64202,3,0,'Зандалары вернут прежние дни.',12,0,100,274,0,0,64661,0,'Мастер проклятий из племени Гурубаши to Player'),
(64202,4,0,'Против зандаларов и могу сразу? Кишка тонка.',12,0,100,0,0,0,64662,0,'Мастер проклятий из племени Гурубаши to Player'),
(64231,3,0,'Если ты хочешь улучшить свои навыки в кулинарии, я могу поделиться с тобой своими знаниями.',12,0,100,0,0,0,68293,0,'Суншинь Железная Лапа to Player'),
(64236,0,0,'У всех есть кристаллы?',12,0,100,1,0,0,61997,0,'Тажань Чжу to Player'),
(64240,0,0,'Don\'t hold back.',12,0,100,1,0,0,63750,0,'Gossip text'),
(64241,1,0,'The mogu are attack the temple!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(64243,0,0,'По тайной лестнице сбегает саурок и тащит кое-какие сокровища!',41,0,100,0,0,0,64421,0,'Глинтрок-разведчик to Player'),
(64259,0,0,'Pick any of these fabolous rods and CAREFULLY tug the line. That should help set the hook into whatever\'s flailin\' around at the other end.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(64280,0,0,'I call upon the waters of my native land ... Bring my enemies to me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,64153,0,'Маки Водорез to Маки Водорез'),
(64281,0,0,'Фум-м!',12,0,100,2,0,0,65569,0,'Сатай Бюй to Player'),
(64283,4,0,'%s начинает преследовать |3-3($n)!',41,0,100,0,0,31564,49578,0,'Янтарная сфера to Player'),
(64312,0,0,'Hmmm, I reckon I don\'t know, $R. All I can understand is the part about the valley - that\'s right here! The Valley of the Four Winds!',12,0,0,1,0,0,64254,0,'Smart Text'),
(64313,0,0,'The maiden, eh? Hmm, I remember that\'s what my father used to call that river to the north. Other than that, I wouldn\'t have the slightest clue.',12,0,0,1,0,0,64252,0,'Smart Text'),
(64315,0,0,'Oh, I HAVE heard of the ancestors\' stair. That\'s what some folks call those mountains to the north.',12,0,0,1,0,0,64255,0,'Smart Text'),
(64327,0,0,'What echoes and what\'s dark? It\'s simple! A cave!',12,0,0,1,0,0,64253,0,'Smart Text'),
(64330,0,0,'Думаешь, сможешь одолеть меня в битве? Многие маленькие девочки боятся змей, а по-моему, они такие лапочки!',12,0,100,0,0,0,64260,0,'Джулия Стивенс to Player'),
(64331,3,0,'Нет, милый. Тебе нужно вырасти большим и сильным. Ты ведь хочешь стать таким же сильным, как я?',12,0,100,0,0,0,64245,0,'Бри Лан'),
(64361,0,0,'Дядюшка Гао, ты должен был присматривать за пивоварней. Что ты наделал?',12,0,100,0,0,0,61478,0,'Чэнь Буйный Портер to Player'),
(64361,3,0,'А в главном хранилище – гну-сини.',12,0,100,5,0,29774,63022,0,'Чэнь Буйный Портер to Player'),
(64367,0,0,'Сущность Юй-лун тепло улыбается вам, растворяясь в небе.',16,0,100,0,0,0,72870,0,'Невидимка to Невидимка'),
(64367,1,0,'Сущность Сюэня издает триумфальный рык и превращается в небесную пыль.',16,0,100,0,0,0,72876,0,'Невидимка to Невидимка'),
(64367,2,0,'Сущность Чи-Цзи рассеивается, оставляя за собой след из звездной пыли.',16,0,100,0,0,0,72869,0,'Невидимка to Невидимка'),
(64367,3,0,'Сущность Нюцзао рокочет, принимая вашу помощь.',16,0,100,0,0,0,72871,0,'Невидимка to Невидимка'),
(64451,3,0,'Купи яблочко! Яблоко в день убережет от жрецов.',12,0,100,0,0,0,64642,0,'Юнь Яблочная Бочка'),
(64467,3,0,'Эй, $p, выход здесь.',12,0,100,0,0,0,64860,0,'Лучница Ли to Player'),
(64473,0,0,'Do not worry, I will go easy on you.',12,0,100,1,0,0,62546,0,'Gossip text'),
(64482,3,0,'Нам нужна пинта холодного пива! Сейчас же!',14,0,100,0,0,0,66666,0,'Целительница Нань'),
(64492,3,0,'Все готово? Отлично. Иди сюда.',12,0,100,273,0,30054,64697,0,'Хранитель истории Чо to Player'),
(64506,3,0,'Он на земле! Давай же прикончим его!',12,0,100,0,0,27382,64768,0,'Аиса Воспевающая Облака to Чжао-жэнь'),
(64517,0,0,'$p, сюда! К мосту!',12,0,100,1,0,0,64811,0,'Шадо-мастер Чум Киу to Player'),
(64528,0,0,'Ah, another stranger from beyond the mists.',12,0,100,0,0,0,65214,0,''),
(64528,1,0,'Ten thousand years ago, the last Pandaren Emperor came seeking my advice. He, too, was filled with conflict. Let us see if you are correct, Taran. Let us see how this stranger deals with the turmoil of the soul.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(64528,2,0,'We can agree it is noble to fight for a righteous cause: to defend home or family. But what of vengeance? What of anger? I sense these emotions run deep in this one.',12,0,100,0,0,0,65273,0,''),
(64528,3,0,'Well spoken, Zhi. The strangers from beyond the mists have no shortage of passions, but let us see if they indeed control them. Beyond anger lies hatred, the wellspring of all misery. What is this? Your hatred has a face!',12,0,100,0,0,0,65326,0,''),
(64528,4,0,'Well, this one has indeed proven mastery over anger. Between the young cub\'s words and the actions of this hero, I think I understand. Those from beyond the mists are hardened by battle. They are scarred, yes, but they have learned much. I trust them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(64528,5,0,'It is decided. I will open the gates. The Vale of Eternal Blossoms will be open for all.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(64528,6,0,'I will consult the others. Meet me at the gates.',12,0,100,0,0,0,65354,0,''),
(64536,3,0,'Великий Тигр, чужеземцам, которые явились из-за туманов, нельзя верить. Тому доказательство руины в Нефритовом лесу.',12,0,100,396,0,0,64886,0,'Тажань Чжу to Player'),
(64537,3,0,'Как интересно. Они принесли много хорошего в эти земли. Но вместе с этим с ними придет и война.',12,0,100,5,0,0,65329,0,'Чжи Безмятежный to Player'),
(64540,3,0,'Да, гнев живет в наших душах, но мы ценим умение контролировать свои эмоции. Даже орки, которые когда-то были охвачены гневом и жаждой крови, смогли победить свою ярость.',12,0,100,396,0,0,65322,0,'Андуин Ринн to Player'),
(64547,3,0,'I heard the ruler wants to make us fight each other. But for this, it seems, and especially do not need to try.',12,0,100,5,0,0,61320,0,'Гуртанский задира'),
(64548,3,0,'Другие кланы, небось, и магией уже не владеют. Что от них толку королю?',12,0,100,11,0,0,61317,0,'Рубака клана Каргеш'),
(64549,0,0,'На крышах появляются ледяные стрелки Шадо-Пан.',41,0,100,0,0,0,64855,0,'Ледяной стрелок Шадо-Пан to Player'),
(64549,1,0,'Стрелки Шадо-Пан исчезают!',41,0,100,0,0,0,59331,0,'Ледяной стрелок Шадо-Пан to Player'),
(64561,3,0,'Not today, little one. We have errands to run.',12,0,100,0,0,0,65057,0,'Jong Ming-Yiu'),
(64562,0,0,'Готовься к смерти, злодей!',14,0,100,0,0,0,65253,0,'Говорящий череп to Player'),
(64562,3,0,'Вот и все. Проклятие снято. Спасибо тебе, $p. Спасибо.',12,0,100,0,0,0,65225,0,'Призрак лорда Алексея Барова to Player'),
(64563,3,0,'Вот и все. Проклятие снято. Спасибо тебе, $p. Спасибо.',12,0,100,1,0,0,65225,0,'Призрак лорда Алексея Барова to Player'),
(64575,3,0,'Боюсь, нам придется здесь задержаться. Орда может защитить нас.',12,0,100,0,0,0,65064,0,'Чань Хой-Сань'),
(64578,3,0,'I want to play with my toys. I want to go home.',12,0,100,0,0,0,65062,0,'Цзун Цзюнь-Кит'),
(64579,3,0,'Can we go see the serpents?',12,0,100,0,0,0,65056,0,'Jong Wik-Wung'),
(64596,0,0,'Мэр Хан, мы должны действовать решительно! Нужно хотя бы собрать стражников!',12,0,100,5,0,0,67702,0,'Тэн Яблоневый Цвет to Player'),
(64597,0,0,'Mmmmm, I haven\'t tasted a brew of this complexity and clarity since... well... since the golden age of the Stormstout Brewery! Whoever made this has a real talent.',12,0,100,0,0,0,65914,0,'Nana Mudclaw to player'),
(64616,0,0,'Very good. Let`s talk.',12,0,100,1,0,29136,65088,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,1,0,'Tong! Drinks, please.',12,0,100,1,0,29137,65089,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,2,0,'My father, Deathwing, tried to destroy the whole of Azeroth.',12,0,100,1,0,29138,65090,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,3,0,'He was misguided, of course, but he was right about one thing: Our world is... so fragile.',12,0,100,1,0,29139,65091,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,4,0,'Wa are a point of light in a universe of shadow. A candle in a tempest.',12,0,100,1,0,29140,65092,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,5,0,'Sometimes I think it was the very precariousness of our world that drove my father to madness.',12,0,100,1,0,29141,65093,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,6,0,'Ah, thank you Tong.',12,0,100,1,0,29142,65094,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,7,0,'Now to my point: I believe we are headed towards a reckoning. And no, I am not talking about the current conflict between the Aliance and the Horde.',12,0,100,1,0,29143,65095,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,8,0,'Believe me - what Garrosh Hellscream achieved in Theramore is nothing compared to the horrors that are even now bearing down on our fragile home.',12,0,100,1,0,29144,65096,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,9,0,'But the war deeply trubles me. Do you see my concern',12,0,100,1,0,29145,65097,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,10,0,'A divided Azeroth cannot possibly stand against the darkness.',12,0,100,1,0,29146,65098,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,11,0,'This war has to end. Soon. Before it consumes our Strength!',12,0,100,1,0,29147,65099,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,12,0,'You can rest assured that my loyalties lie with Horde.',12,0,100,1,0,29149,65101,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,13,0,'How do we bring a swift and decisive end to the conflict? I believe the answer lies with heroes like you.',12,0,100,1,0,29150,65102,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,26,0,'You can rest assured that my loyalties lie with Aliance.',12,0,100,1,0,29148,65100,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,28,0,'Tong! Something to eat, please.',12,0,100,1,0,34610,70329,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,29,0,'Garrosh Hellscream! Warchief of the Horde.',12,0,100,1,0,34574,70343,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,30,0,'He did not always command such power.',12,0,100,1,0,34575,70344,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,31,0,'On Draenor, he was a miserable wretch. The actions of his father hung heavy on his heart.',12,0,100,1,0,34576,70345,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,32,0,'I understand you, Garrosh. I know what it is like to bear the weight of your father\'s deeds.',12,0,100,1,0,34577,70346,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,33,0,'A warrior like Garrosh comes to power with something to prove.',12,0,100,1,0,34578,70347,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,34,0,'Your Horde finds itself at a turning point. This war will define you.',12,0,100,1,0,34579,70348,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,35,0,'What IS the Horde?',12,0,100,1,0,34580,70349,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,36,0,'Is it an instrument of vengeance, hellbent to carve out a future for its people?',12,0,100,1,0,34581,70350,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,37,0,'Is it a refuge for those who need shelter, a commonwealth of the downtrodden, built for mutual support?',12,0,100,1,0,34582,70351,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,38,0,'Or is it an alliance of convenience, a confederacy of unlikely partners free to pursue their own agendas?',12,0,100,1,0,34583,70352,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,39,0,'I asked you: Who is the soul of the Horde?',12,0,100,1,0,34584,70374,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,40,0,'We will find the answers here in Pandaria.',12,0,100,1,0,34585,70354,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,41,0,'Show me what your Horde is made of, Champion!',12,0,100,1,0,34586,70355,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,42,0,'Prove to me that your Horde is worthy of ruling over Azeroth.',12,0,100,1,0,34587,70356,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,44,0,'The High King. Varian Wrynn - Leader of the Alliance.',12,0,100,1,0,34561,70330,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,45,0,'Did you know, he was once a gladiator? Oh yes, I\'ve been doing my research.',12,0,100,1,0,34562,70331,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,46,0,'Suffering from amnesia, he fought for his life in Horde arenas.',12,0,100,1,0,34563,70332,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,47,0,'There, he earned the name "Lo\'Gosh," or "Ghost Wolf."',12,0,100,1,0,34564,70333,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,48,0,'He IS a fighter. But... is he a leader?',12,0,100,1,0,34565,70334,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,49,0,'Think about it! His enemies took advantage of my father\'s Cataclysm.',12,0,100,1,0,34566,70335,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,50,0,'Horde soldiers thundered across the realm in the wake of the devastation.',12,0,100,1,0,34567,70336,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,51,0,'Varian Wrynn didn\'t use the disaster to gain a military advantage.',12,0,100,1,0,34568,70337,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,52,0,'Is this because he is weak...? Or because he is principled?',12,0,100,1,0,34569,70338,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,53,0,'Here\'s the bigger question: Can principles win a war?',12,0,100,1,0,34570,70339,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,54,0,'Make no mistake. Pandaria will challenge your King.',12,0,100,1,0,34571,70340,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,55,0,'Let us see what he is truly made of.',12,0,100,1,0,34572,70341,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,56,0,'Let us see if your Alliance has what it takes to rule Azeroth.',12,0,100,1,0,34573,70342,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,57,0,'You have proven to be an exemplary hero. A champion for your cause.',12,0,100,1,0,34602,70371,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,58,0,'Do you recall our earlier conversation?',12,0,100,1,0,34603,70372,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,59,0,'We spoke of your Warchief. His inner conflicts and his outer conquests.',12,0,100,1,0,34604,70373,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,61,0,'Your efforts on Padaria\'s southern shore and elsewhere have given me my answer.',12,0,100,1,0,34606,70375,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,62,0,'YOU are the soul of the Horde.',12,0,100,1,0,34607,70376,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,63,0,'Your actions in the coming weeks will come to define your people.',12,0,100,1,0,34608,70377,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,64,0,'I want to make sure that you are properly equipped for the trials ahead.',12,0,100,1,0,34609,70378,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,65,0,'Tong: fetch my things!',12,0,100,1,0,34597,70366,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,66,0,'Your dedication to your cause deserves to be rewarded.',12,0,100,1,0,34598,70367,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,67,0,'Like you, I continue to refine my skills here in Pandaria. I think you will appreciate the outcome.',12,0,100,1,0,34599,70368,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,68,0,'Choose your reward!',12,0,100,1,0,34600,70369,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,71,0,'We discussed the merits of your High King. I have been observing him closely.',12,0,100,1,0,34590,70359,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,72,0,'It is true: he has the spirit of the wolf. And he fights like a wolf.',12,0,100,1,0,34591,70360,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,73,0,'Having seen him in action, I now know what that means.',12,0,100,1,0,34592,70361,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,74,0,'Wolves are pack animals.',12,0,100,1,0,34593,70362,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,75,0,'Your King is calling his pack to him, assembling an Alliance in the truest sense of the word.',12,0,100,1,0,34594,70363,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,76,0,'His journey is long. He has only taken the first steps.',12,0,100,1,0,34595,70364,0,'Smart Text'),
(64616,77,0,'But with heroes like you in his pack, there is little your Alliance cannot accomplish.',12,0,100,1,0,34596,70365,0,'Smart Text'),
(64623,3,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warlock_improvedsoulleech:20|tВы попали под действие заклинания |cFFFF0000|Hspell:126228|h[Покалеченная душа]|h|r! Убивать!',42,0,100,0,0,0,65154,0,'Severed Soul to Player'),
(64631,3,0,'Колдунство троллей – самое сильное колдунство!',12,0,100,0,0,0,10437,0,'Знахарь из племени Гурубаши to Player'),
(64648,3,0,'Лучники, в атаку! Пусть сгорит дотла!',14,0,100,0,0,0,65347,0,'Капитан стражи Шадо-Пан to Кри\'чон'),
(64738,3,0,'Присев на колени, рыцарь в капюшоне осматривает и обыскивает тело ткача пламени.',16,0,100,0,0,0,65386,0,'Рыцарь в капюшоне to Player'),
(64757,4,0,'Есть, свет!',14,0,100,0,0,0,65504,0,'Шонуф to Шонуф'),
(64822,0,0,'I often venture out here to think. The view is breathtaking, would you agree?',12,0,100,1,0,29124,65109,0,'Smart Text'),
(64822,1,0,'Pandaria is indeed a jewel. Such beauty. It makes you want to protect her, yes?',12,0,100,1,0,29125,65110,0,'Smart Text'),
(64822,2,0,'I feel the same way about Azeroth herself.',12,0,100,1,0,29126,65111,0,'Smart Text'),
(64822,3,0,'You have done great things, friend. I can assure you this is but the beginning of our work together.',12,0,100,1,0,29127,65112,0,'Smart Text'),
(64822,4,0,'Behold: The power of the foes you`ve vanquished.',12,0,100,1,0,29128,65113,0,'Smart Text'),
(64822,5,0,'And the wisdom of those you`ve outsmarted.',12,0,100,1,0,29129,65114,0,'Smart Text'),
(64822,6,0,'Here! The embodiment of the fear that you`ve conquered. May it now strike terror into the hearts of your enemies!',12,0,100,1,0,29130,65115,0,'Smart Text'),
(64822,7,0,'Finally, a gift from me. Make no mistake: the Black Dragonflight lives on!',12,0,100,1,0,29131,65116,0,'Smart Text'),
(64822,8,0,'There. My work is done. You can now greatly augment the power of any sha-touched weapon.',12,0,100,1,0,29132,65117,0,'Smart Text'),
(64841,3,0,'Готово. У тебя получилось, $p!',12,0,100,1,0,0,65470,0,'Рыцарь в капюшоне to Player'),
(64916,4,0,'%s приходит в ярость, разлучаясь со своим призывателеи янтаря!',41,0,100,0,0,0,65747,0,'Кор\'тик - страж роя'),
(65111,4,0,'Артиллерия богомолов уже здесь! Торопитесь, герои!',12,0,100,397,0,0,64838,0,'Защитник Змеиного Хребта to Крик\'тик-разведчик'),
(65160,3,0,'Wrathion\'s agents whisper quietly to one another.',16,0,100,0,0,0,67584,0,'Blacktalon Watcher'),
(65173,4,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\trade_archaeology_delicatemusicbox.blp:20|tИмператорский визирь Зор\'лок исполняет |cFFFF0000|Hspell:123791|h[песнь императрице]|h|r, наносящую урон всем игрокам до тех пор, пока они не вступят с ним в схватку!',41,0,100,0,0,0,63775,0,'Эхо поглощения to Эхо поглощения'),
(65253,0,0,'Hold off the Zan\'thik while Rik\'kal the Dissector gathers his strength.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,''),
(65315,0,0,'На старт! 3...',42,0,100,0,0,0,66167,0,'Roll Club to Player'),
