(96470,1,1,'I\'ve done my best to calibrate the burette. Give Deucus my regards.',12,0,0,0,0,0,98367,0,''),
(96474,0,0,'Deucus? That undead has some nerve! Called me a cheater once... but I suppose I can forgive him. Lemme see...',12,0,0,0,0,0,98369,0,''),
