(96527,10,0,'Doomhammer... it felt like dead weight in my hands. The elements were silent. It has been this way since I used it to slay Garrosh.',12,0,100,1,0,0,106994,0,'Тралл to Dave\'s Industrial Light and Magic Bunny (Small)(Sessile)'),
