(96686,4,0,'Truthfully, Stormheim holds another treasure. One that I will be pursuing by my own means.',12,0,100,0,0,0,98652,0,'Леди Сильвана Ветрокрылая to Player'),
(96686,5,0,'Nathanos has been training a new generation of rangers. They represent both our past, and our future.',12,0,100,0,0,0,98654,0,'Леди Сильвана Ветрокрылая to Player'),
(96686,6,0,'I think often about our future, hero. My people cannot reproduce. Are we not destined, then, to wither away eventually?',12,0,100,0,0,0,98655,0,'Леди Сильвана Ветрокрылая to Player'),
