(102655,1,0,'I\'d like to introduce you to Calia Menethil. Yes that Menethil. She has been an incredible help these past few years. I\'d like for her to work for you, helping the helpless, taking your word to the world, all that.',12,0,100,0,0,0,105153,0,'Алонсий Фаол to Player'),
