(103144,3,0,'For many ages, the sword has kept the beast from rising again. But now it stirs once more, so I must ask you delve into the depths of the tomb and finish what I started. I will go with you, to offer what aid I can.',12,0,100,0,0,0,105782,0,'Торадин to 1037'),
