(106418,0,0,'Пф... Мое отсутствие заметят! Меня будут искать!',12,0,100,0,0,67237,116441,0,'Анари Лунарх to Player'),
(106429,0,0,'Ah, there you are. We\'ve secured the area and found the bodies of our brethren.',12,0,100,0,0,0,109479,0,'Травар to Player'),
(106429,1,0,'The hammer is not far from the entrance but we will need to be quick. Even with the Twilight\'s Hammer gone I can sense evil coming from the tomb.',12,0,100,0,0,0,109480,0,'Травар to Player'),
(106429,2,0,'We will take a small team to lead the way. Aid us as best you can. Let me know when you are ready.',12,0,100,0,0,0,109481,0,'Травар to Player'),
(106429,3,0,'We will have to swim a little, but it won\'t take long.',12,0,100,0,0,0,109570,0,'Травар to Player'),
(106429,4,0,'Behold the Tomb of Tyr, built by the mighty... wait! What foul monsters are these?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,109571,0,'Травар to Player'),
(106429,5,0,'This cannot stand! Destroy the abominations!',12,0,100,0,0,0,109572,0,'Травар to Player'),
(106429,6,0,'It pains me to see this destruction, I have never seen beyond these doors until now. The Silver Hand is in there, let us go.',12,0,100,0,0,0,109575,0,'Травар to Flesh Spawn'),
(106429,7,0,'Look above you! Our sacred artifact is there, just beyond reach! Before we begin let us clear the room. Let me know when you are ready.',12,0,100,0,0,0,109839,0,'Травар to Player'),
(106429,8,0,'Watch yourselves, men! Let\'s cleanse this chamber!',12,0,100,0,0,0,109893,0,'Травар to Player'),
