(109954,4,0,'Иллюзия... рассеялась.',12,0,100,0,0,0,116341,0,'Магистр Федрис to Player'),
(109955,0,0,'Where are your comrades, Jergosh? All dead? How... inconvenient.',12,0,100,1,0,66441,116382,0,'Нагаз to Player'),
(109955,1,0,'Hmmph... I saw Tyranis go off to the right before I was forced to retreat.',12,0,100,0,0,66444,116387,0,'Нагаз to Player'),
(109955,2,0,'Found Tyranis too late, did you? Too bad...',12,0,100,0,0,66445,116456,0,'Нагаз to Player'),
(109955,3,0,'Anyway, I\'ve... found something. Follow me! I need your help.',12,0,100,0,0,66446,116457,0,'Нагаз to Player'),
(109955,4,0,'I\'ll have that book now, Jergosh... and you\'ll be having a little accident! Heh!',12,0,100,0,0,66447,116458,0,'Нагаз to Player'),
(109955,5,0,'I should be... the one... at Gul\'dan\'s side...',12,0,100,0,0,66448,116459,0,'Нагаз to 1860'),
(109956,0,0,'Ah, you are Jergosh, yes? I assume by your arrival that the Book of Medivh is in your possession. Your timing could have been better.',12,0,100,1,0,66440,116381,0,'Athrikus Narassin to Player'),
(109956,1,0,'It matters not. Gul\'dan knows the Eye is here, but Tol Barad is huge and overrun. I believe an important document, a manifest of prisoners, is located in this block.',12,0,100,1,0,66442,116383,0,'Athrikus Narassin to Player'),
(109956,2,0,'In his wisdom, Nagaz here sent his only remaining disciple to scout below. I suggest you go see what happened to him while we search elsewhere.',12,0,100,1,0,66443,116385,0,'Athrikus Narassin to Player'),
(109956,3,0,'Came up empty? No Nagaz either, I see. Not to worry, we all know how the lower echelons of our group scramble for position. Enough nonsense. What we seek is here!',12,0,100,0,0,66449,116484,0,'Athrikus Narassin to Player'),
(109956,4,0,'There! The unquiet dead bar our way. Get that spirit out of my way, will you?',12,0,100,0,0,66451,116487,0,'Athrikus Narassin to Player'),
(109956,5,0,'Hmm... I see. This entry speaks of a void terror, I\'m sure. It must have consumed the Eye in the Twisting Nether. Its purpose here is irrelevant. Let us get to Baradin Hold. Quickly, Jergosh!',12,0,100,0,0,66452,116489,0,'Athrikus Narassin to Armond Thaco'),
(109956,6,0,'It is here the most dangerous prisoners were kept. Do not wander, orc. No telling what may lurk in the shadows...',12,0,100,0,0,66456,116967,0,'Athrikus Narassin to Player'),
(109956,7,0,'To think the Horde and Alliance once waged war to control this prison. As usual, their small-minded efforts were misguided and futile.',12,0,100,0,0,66457,116968,0,'Athrikus Narassin to Player'),
(109956,8,0,'In your brief life span, I\'m sure you have never faced a void terror, Jergosh. Avoid its eye attacks and stay out of my way. I am not here to protect you!',12,0,100,0,0,66458,116969,0,'Athrikus Narassin to Player'),
(109956,9,0,'The beast falls! I am victorious once again.',12,0,100,0,0,66453,116972,0,'Athrikus Narassin to Occul\'tharon'),
(109956,10,0,'I\'ll retrieve the Eye. No doubt your crude attempts at its removal would cause irreparable damage.',12,0,100,0,0,66454,116973,0,'Athrikus Narassin to Occul\'tharon'),
