(110533,2,0,'With the Book of Medivh, the Eye of Dalaran, and the Scepter of Sargeras, we will rip open the gates to all the demon worlds! We will bring the full power of the Legion to bear on this pitiful planet.',14,0,100,1,0,66426,117566,0,'Гул\'дан to Player'),
