(220026,0,0,'I\'ll get started on fixin\' it up with stuff I have around the shop.',12,0,0,0,0,0,105602,0,''),
(220026,1,1,'Let me just insert this into the core and we\'ll see what happens.',12,0,0,0,0,0,104804,0,''),
(220026,2,2,'Flashy, but ineffective. We\'ll have to try something else. Maybe we need a chemical reaction.',12,0,0,0,0,0,104805,0,''),
(220026,3,3,'Go to the alchemy shop and ask Deucus for a potion with some punch in it.',12,0,0,0,0,0,104806,0,''),
(220026,4,4,'Alright, I\'m going to pour in the solution now. Watch yourself, not sure how this is going to react.',12,0,0,0,0,0,104807,0,''),
(220026,5,5,'Are you alright? *Cough, cough* I\'m thinking the only thing that\'s going to work here is a fel-infused core.',12,0,0,0,0,0,104808,0,''),
(220026,6,6,'It\'s a long shot, but there may be someone here in Dalaran who has one. Try asking Bonegrim in the Ledgerdemain Lounge if he\'s come across any.',12,0,0,0,0,0,104809,0,''),
(220026,7,7,'You found something?! That\'s amazing! You\'re amazing, $n! Keep your fingers crossed, I\'m gonna put it in now.',12,0,0,0,0,0,104810,0,''),
(220026,8,8,'Success!',12,0,0,0,0,0,87235,0,''),
(220027,0,0,'Alright, let\'s see what we can do with this ore. First things first: we heat the ore.',12,0,100,0,0,0,98567,0,''),
(220027,1,0,'Now let\'s see what we can make with it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,98568,0,''),
(220027,2,0,'Shaping the ore...',12,0,100,0,0,0,98591,0,''),
(220027,3,0,'Look how easily it bends...',12,0,100,0,0,0,98592,0,''),
(220027,4,0,'And now for the simple step of applying the flux. Lean in closely and watch my technique.',12,0,100,0,0,0,98569,0,''),
(220027,5,0,'Ну, давай-ка посмотрим, что можно сделать с этим доспехом.',12,0,100,1,0,0,126927,0,'Алард Шмид to Player'),
(220027,6,0,'Сперва надо переплавить всю руду...',12,0,100,0,0,0,126928,0,'Алард Шмид to Player'),
(220027,7,0,'А теперь хорошенько отковать заготовку из силового камня... вот здесь... и-и-и здесь...',12,0,100,0,0,0,126929,0,'Алард Шмид to Player'),
(220027,8,0,'И наконец – главная драгоценность!',12,0,100,0,0,0,126930,0,'Алард Шмид to Player'),
(220027,9,0,'Готово! Одна из лучших моих работ, как по мне! Можешь забирать.',12,0,100,1,0,0,126931,0,'Алард Шмид to Player'),
(220027,10,0,'Грейсон будет доволен нашей работой. Передай ему мои наилучшие пожелания.',12,0,100,1,0,0,126932,0,'Алард Шмид to Player'),
